<title>JAPAN: Nissho Inter Life - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nissho Inter Life - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 20, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
